## Project Structure

### Monorepo Organization

Poetry workspace (`package-mode = false` at root) for Python packages, plus a pnpm workspace for the web SPA:

| Tree path | Distribution name | Import root | Status |
| --------- | ----------------- | ----------- | ------ |
| `modules/model/` | `papita-transactions-model` | `papita_txnsmodel` | Active; published to PyPI / TestPyPI |
| `modules/api/` | `papita-transactions-api` | `papita_txnsapi` | Active FastAPI MVP (PPT-032) |
| `modules/web/` | `@papita/web` | (Vite/React app; `@/*` alias) | Active SPA (PPT-046 / #112); presentation only — **no JS domain logic** |
| `modules/ingestor-core/` | `papita-ingestor-core` | `papita_ingestor_core` | Scaffold (PPT-077 / #171); contracts only — plugins under `modules/ingestors/` |
| `modules/ingestors/email/` | `papita-ingestor-email` | `papita_ingestor_email` | Scaffold (PPT-077 / #171); Gmail plugin shell — **no OAuth/parsers yet** |

**Database:** PostgreSQL only. Schema: `papita_transactions`.

**Web toolchain:** Node 22 + pnpm 9 (`pnpm-workspace.yaml` at repo root). Separate from Poetry — `pnpm install` / `make web-dev`. Setup SSOT: `modules/web/README.md`.

### Model module layout

```
modules/model/
├── src/papita_txnsmodel/
│   ├── model/           # SQLModel tables (BaseSQLModel)
│   ├── access/          # DTOs + repositories per domain
│   ├── services/        # business logic (BaseService)
│   ├── handlers/        # load/dump pipelines
│   ├── database/        # SQLDatabaseConnector, upsert helpers
│   └── __meta__.py
├── alembic/             # migrations (alembic.ini in module root)
├── tests/
└── pyproject.toml
```

### API module layout

```
modules/api/
├── src/papita_txnsapi/
│   ├── main.py          # create_app, lifespan, ASGI `app`
│   ├── config/          # settings, environment, logger.yaml
│   ├── core/            # security, exceptions, redis, rate_limit, db_health
│   ├── dependencies/    # auth, pagination, services, redis
│   ├── routers/v1/      # health, auth, accounts, categories, transactions, movements, reports, budgets
│   ├── schemas/         # request/response, query_params, converters
│   └── middleware/
├── tests/
└── pyproject.toml
```

**API layer rule:** routers validate auth, map schemas, and delegate to `papita_txnsmodel` services — no business logic in routers.

### Web module layout

```
modules/web/
├── src/                 # React app (pages, components, api/, forms/)
├── openapi/             # committed openapi.json (typegen strategy B)
├── e2e/                 # Playwright + seed helpers
├── package.json         # @papita/web
└── README.md            # Node/pnpm setup, BFF, quality
```

**Web layer rule:** UI + TanStack Query + BFF cookie session only. Do not reimplement `papita_txnsmodel` services in TypeScript. nginx Compose packaging is PPT-057 / #122; CSP / SPA security headers are PPT-063 / #128.

### Import Paths

- Absolute imports from package roots: `from papita_txnsmodel.access.accounts.dto import AccountDTO`.
- Add `src/` to `sys.path` in tests via `conftest.py` / pytest config.
- isort `known_first_party`: `papita_txnsapi`, `papita_txnsmodel`, `papita_ingestor_core`, `papita_ingestor_email`.
- Ingestor graph (one-way): plugins → `papita_ingestor_core` → `papita_txnsmodel`. API/web must not import plugins.

### Environments and secrets

- Secrets live under `environments/<local|staging|production>/` — never under `modules/` or `docker/`.
- Committed: `environments/<name>/.env.example`. Gitignored: `environments/<name>/.env`.
- Select with `PAPITA_ENV` (default `local`) or `--env` on `bin/` scripts.
- Supabase is **Auth-only** for MVP (`AUTH_PROVIDER=supabase`); `AUTH_PROVIDER=local` is B0 pytest only.

### Repo scripts (`bin/` by language)

Developer/ops entrypoints (CI wrappers stay under `.github/scripts/`):

| Folder | Contents |
| ------ | -------- |
| `bin/bash/` | Shell entrypoints: `alembic.sh`, `test.sh`, `package.sh`, `utils.sh` (`resolve_repo_root`), smokes, OpenAPI/E2E wrappers |
| `bin/python/` | Python helpers: `export_openapi.py`, `web_e2e_seed.py`, legacy `setup_duckdb.py` (each uses `resolve_repo_root()`) |
| `bin/make/` | Make fragments included from root `Makefile` (`./bin/bash/…` invocations) |

### Make fragments (`bin/make/*.mk`)

| File | Role |
| ---- | ---- |
| `bin/make/api.mk` | API Compose/runtime targets (`api-up`, `api-all`, smokes); path filter for `publish-api-image.yml` |
| `bin/make/web.mk` | Web SPA targets; path filter for `web-ci.yml` |
| `bin/make/ingestor.mk` | `ingestor-install` / `ingestor-test` / `ingestor-lint`; path filter for `ingestor-ci.yml` |

Root `Makefile` includes all three. Do not retarget domain CI to the whole root Makefile.

### Docker / Compose

| Path | Role |
| ---- | ---- |
| `docker/README.md` | GHCR naming + publish SSOT (PPT-067 / #132); model = PyPI; API + web containers |
| `docker/database/docker-compose.yml` | Local Postgres 15 (B0) |
| `docker/docker-compose.yml` | API + Postgres + Redis + nginx SPA stack |
| `docker/api/Dockerfile` | uvicorn `CMD` SSOT (`papita_txnsapi.main:app`); base digest pinned |
| `docker/web/Dockerfile` | multi-stage pnpm → nginx:alpine (PPT-057 / #122); SPA CSP snippet PPT-063 / #128 |
| `docker/web/nginx.conf` | SPA fallback + `/api` proxy (BFF cookie Path=/api) |
| `docker/web/spa-security-headers.conf` | CSP + baseline headers for static SPA locations (PPT-063 / #128) |
| `docker/redis/` | Redis config for Compose |

Canonical B0 API start: `make api-up` (uvicorn in-container). nginx SPA: `make web-up`. See `ARCHITECTURE.md` Part IX (PPT-045). Registry publish (PPT-067): `publish-api-image.yml` → `save-ma-money-api`, `publish-web-image.yml` → `save-ma-money-web`. Do not promote host `poetry run uvicorn` as the day-to-day path.

