### Dependency Management

- Root `pyproject.toml` workspace; each module has its own `pyproject.toml`.
- Local path deps: `{path = "modules/{module}", develop = true}`.
- API depends on published/path `papita-transactions-model`.
- `poetry.lock` is gitignored — CI resolves via `poetry install`.

### Code Quality

- Pre-commit: Black, isort, mypy, pylint, flake8, pytest; interrogate target 90%+.
- Coverage: `docs/coverage.xml` from `modules/{model,api}/src` (ingestor ≥80% deferred to PPT-084 / #178; gate is `ingestor-ci.yml`).
- Semantic versioning in `__meta__.py` / module `pyproject.toml`.
